WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.552
Welcome to Module 4.

00:00:01.552 --> 00:00:06.984
Today we go talk about di numbers wey really matter for your business.

00:00:07.684 --> 00:00:10.963
Plenty people dey confuse sales with profit.

00:00:10.963 --> 00:00:19.012
If you sell one hundred thousand naira, but you spend seventy thousand, your profit na only thirty thousand.

00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:24.837
Profit margin tell you how much you dey keep from every one hundred naira.

00:00:24.837 --> 00:00:30.032
Thirty percent mean say from every hundred naira, thirty naira na your own.

00:00:30.732 --> 00:00:38.580
Watch your average sale, which product dey carry di biggest share, and how dis month take compare with last month.

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:47.200
With dis numbers, when you increase price, you go see whether profit go up, or customers don begin run.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.124
Calculate your profit margin for last month.

00:00:52.124 --> 00:00:54.140
See you for Module 5!
